BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (calls it a five-character alphanumeric identifier issued by the Defense Logistics Agency to U.S. entities, with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (foreign firms receiving an NCAGE code instead, and says a valid CAGE or NCAGE is needed to finish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (SAM.gov registration and bid on contracts [rRWCLLWqrV0 @ 00:00:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The practitioners also agree on what not to chase. Eric Coffie is blunt that nobody needs a CAGE code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (before registering: once the entity information is submitted for processing, the government assigns the code) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (and adds it to the SAM record, and the registrant does 'not a thing' beyond finishing the SAM flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm ([wcz-GpTaAp8 @ 00:01:36]. The lever the operator does control is the registration purpose. FedOpp says to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (choose Register Entity rather than a UEI-only record and to select All Awards, because an ID alone will not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (let a firm bid as a prime [2Bp78kNCVGI @ 00:01:48]. Kizzy Parks makes the identical call on screen, telling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (viewers they are interested in all awards because a CAGE code is required to obtain a prime government) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (contract, and that nearly everyone watching should answer no to the government-entity question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm ([wNMt73DArFc @ 00:01:59]. Her pre-flight kit is short and deliberately forgiving: business banking details, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (plain personal checking if no business account exists yet; a copy of the IRS-issued EIN document; a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (physical address affiliated with the business, whether it is a for-profit or a nonprofit; and at least one NAICS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (code, because every one of these items can be changed after the CAGE lands [wNMt73DArFc @ 00:00:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (The shared message is to stop polishing and push the record through to submission.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (Beyond the base registration, the certification practitioners share one hard rule: SAM.gov comes first. Nick) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (Waters states that no firm can be federally certified without a SAM.gov registration plus a UEI and CAGE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (code, and that being a small business is the next gate, since all four federal programs run directly through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (the SBA [sqfiBzNcTPI @ 00:01:40]. Derek James of GovKidMethod gives the same order, telling viewers to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (have the business entity registered in SAM before applying for any set-aside through the SBA certification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (site, where self-certification is usually easier and faster in his experience [LnPiGkUTs2E @ 00:05:54]. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (the money behind those tags, the speakers converge on a 23% governmentwide small business goal. Neil) Tj ET
