BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 660.00 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 637.77 Tm (The first losses happen inside the registration itself, and most are self-inflicted typos. The taxpayer name) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 622.55 Tm (has to match the IRS record exactly, and Kizzy Parks had her one-time passcode verification fail because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 607.32 Tm (she typed a period after her middle initial. She also had a date rejected for not using double digits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 592.10 Tm ([wNMt73DArFc @ 00:07:15]. On another registration she hit the same wall by adding a period after 'Dr') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 576.87 Tm ([FWfV2m3K4jY @ 00:09:42]. The bigger trap is silence. Kizzy reports that you will typically get zero emails) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 561.65 Tm (telling you it is time to continue entity validation, so she logs in at least weekly once the process starts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 546.42 Tm ([eIFlVzfusWo @ 00:02:23]. After you submit, the CAGE desk checks your physical address and may ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 531.20 Tm (questions about your company. She warns that you must answer that email within three business days and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 515.97 Tm (should call the number at the bottom rather than freeze [FWfV2m3K4jY @ 00:23:28]. Speed varies a lot by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 500.75 Tm (step. Kizzy pulled a UEI in about three minutes, but the CAGE code is only issued after that address) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 485.52 Tm (verification clears. The economics are simple: a stalled CAGE code means you cannot bid as a prime. Put a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 470.30 Tm (weekly login on the calendar, and keep the IRS letter and the lease or proof of residence on hand before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.07 Tm (you start.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 439.85 Tm (Security failures cost real money. Kizzy Parks explains that SAM.gov holds the bank account every prime) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 424.62 Tm (payment goes to. People have created dummy accounts to get in and change the banking details, and then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 409.40 Tm ('poof your money is diverted to them.' That is why she is cautious about letting a third party register for you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.17 Tm ([wNMt73DArFc @ 00:03:30]. Neil McDonnell flags a leak beginners create themselves: posting the EIN on a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 378.95 Tm (website because no one told them not to. He treats the EIN like a Social Security number for the company) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 363.72 Tm (and notes the UEI exists precisely to mask it [QIEmDXcWhSE @ 00:02:33]. Maintenance is the slow failure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.50 Tm (FedOpp says to renew every 365 days and update the record whenever your address, bank, or contacts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 333.27 Tm (change. It also says never to request a second UEI, and warns that an expired registration can block awards) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 318.05 Tm ([2Bp78kNCVGI @ 00:05:15]. When a CAGE code will not show up in a lookup, Federal Processing Registry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 302.82 Tm (lists the usual causes: an expired registration, incorrect data on file, or a submission that was never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 287.60 Tm (completed. The fix is to update the SAM.gov profile or contact DLA support [lcWf2_8nWcc @ 00:01:15].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 272.37 Tm (Treat the SAM profile like a bank login, because that is effectively what it is.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 257.15 Tm (Certification traps hit after approval as often as before. GovKidMethod warns that going over the three-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 241.92 Tm (average size standard on your primary NAICS code costs you your small business status. In 8\(a\), it can get) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 226.70 Tm (you kicked out of the program for growing too quickly, so he tells winners to spread contracts across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 211.47 Tm (different NAICS codes [LnPiGkUTs2E @ 00:22:47]. HUBZone status is fragile too. Firms must notify the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 196.25 Tm (SBA of material changes, such as a new office or falling below the 35% employee residency minimum, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 181.02 Tm (the SBA may visit unannounced to check [LnPiGkUTs2E @ 00:20:45]. Nick Waters GovCon describes male) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 165.80 Tm (owners who list their wife as majority owner while she works a 9-to-5, and says the SBA is getting very good) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 150.57 Tm (at catching it. The woman must own at least 51%, run the day-to-day operations, typically be the highest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 135.35 Tm (paid, and show 40 hours a week on paper [sqfiBzNcTPI @ 00:08:56]. Kizzy Parks adds a marketing failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 120.12 Tm (from her own career. A CDC small business rep praised her patriotic, freshly branded capability statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 104.90 Tm (as pretty, then tore it apart because it had no NAICS codes. Pride turned into embarrassment in the middle) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 89.67 Tm (of an in-person meeting [K_zNUytFOQo @ 00:08:54]. Content beats design every time.) Tj ET
